  "transformations": [
    "Converted Body array-of-structs into six separate float arrays (SoA layout)",
    "Added OpenMP parallel-for over small tiles of 4 bodies with static scheduling",
    "Preloaded tile positions and used #pragma omp simd on the inner t-loop to vectorize across independent force accumulators",
    "Aligned all coordinate/velocity arrays to 64-byte boundaries via posix_memalign"
